  "visualReview": {
    "coverage": "Viewed every page and cover in eight 3×3 contact sheets, then re-viewed every corrected sheet. Full-size final checks: 0122 p06, 0124 p07, 0125 p08, 0128 p06.",
    "notes": [
      "0121: closed flower persists through daylight, loosens at dusk and opens with pale-yellow center; two separate drawings retain closed and open states; seated fairy retains green shoes and brown bag.",
      "0122: large and medium winds precede the small open white shell held near the pinwheel; duplicate bags removed; foreground hands connect to bag and pinwheel; sleeping finale closes the shell, keeps blanket in place and sets bag beside bed.",
      "0123: short curved rocker becomes a longer bed with exactly four legs; headboard retains two green leaves and mouth; cream double-humped camel has blue stitched eye; rocking shifts to the child’s arms and the bed stays stable.",
      "0124: bare feet after shoes are removed; two initial prints are filled, accidental round mark is erased, and alternating animal prints and round stone marks remain at the end; stone hand is visible above mud while smoothing and touches only the wooden rim in the successful scene.",
      "0125: yellow five-point sponge becomes blue, two blue blobs persist as clouds, trial star appears on separate old cloth, crisp stars fill the curtain; washed yellow sponge returns to a plate by the bed; rotated standing shadows and protruding covered feet removed.",
      "0126: blue kettle has a white crescent on its lid; bubbles break before the game is agreed; page five has exactly three bubbles and a visibly empty chair; blocks appear as the agreed route; final single bubble contains moon reflection.",
      "0127: scarf-like hat ties and flag point toward the wall before departure and toward open sand after changing location; plant rides a small wagon around the building, seeds fall only after free rolling, and final seed rests in a sand hollow.",
      "0128: exactly five jam petals merge into a larger smear; dry cloth fails, damp cloth reveals a clean patch, pink wash water and clean snowy pine appear afterward; red flower moves to paper in the finale; outlined arms remain distinct from the squirrel tail and hands meet cleaning cloth."
    ],
    "limits": "Simplified vector picture-book style. Contact sheets inspect composition and continuity; selected pages enlarged. No claim of bitmap painting, audio QA, browser layout QA or child-user testing."
